{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39950","headline":"游灵隐天竺二寺 · 徐夤","name":"游灵隐天竺二寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹井冷泉虚易到，两山真界实难名。\n石和云雾莲华气，月过楼台桂子清。\n腾踏回桥巡像设，罗穿曲洞出龙成。\n更怜童子呼猿去，飒飒萧萧下树行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}